# Enterprise Olist Data Platform

An industry-level End-to-End Data Engineering project built using the Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset by Olist.

## Tech Stack

- Python
- SQL
- PySpark
- Databricks
- Apache Airflow
- AWS S3
- Snowflake
- dbt Core
- Docker
- Terraform
- GitHub Actions

## Architecture

Bronze → Silver → Gold (Medallion Architecture)

> 🚧 Project currently under development.
